  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment of Regional Oncology Center</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support the GoU in alleviating the burden of cancer treatment and care, which significantly impacts the social well-being and economic productivity of the population in the country. Specifically, the project seeks to improve access to oncology services in West Nile and Eastern Uganda through (a) Construction and equipping oncology centers in Arua and Mbale Cities; (ii) Development of human resource capacity for cancer diagnosis and treatment; and (iii) Establishment of a cancer registry system for the targeted regions to monitor trends and treatment outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
